      "headline": "PSD schedules April 20 internal vote on withdrawing support for PM Bolojan, triggering political crisis",
      "summary": "Romania's Social Democrats held a series of regional meetings culminating in an April 20 internal referendum \u2014 branded 'Momentul Adev\u0103rului' \u2014 to vote on withdrawing political support for Prime Minister Ilie Bolojan. PSD president Sorin Grindeanu, party secretary Claudiu Manda, and vice-premier Marian Neac\u0219u led messaging that the coalition in its current form 'cannot continue,' while PNL and USR defended Bolojan and accused PSD of deliberately engineering instability. President Nicu\u0219or Dan declined to take sides publicly. The National Trade Union Bloc (BNS) sent an open letter to all party leaders urging consultations or early elections.",
